1
00:00:00,829 --> 00:00:03,499
In no manner
which would lead one to believe...

2
00:00:03,665 --> 00:00:06,955
(Sheldon:)...that he was covering up feelings
of anguish and betrayal.

3
00:00:07,878 --> 00:00:10,008
(Penny:)-Well, good.
-I'm also pleased to report...

4
00:00:10,172 --> 00:00:13,012
(Sheldon:)...that he's all cried out over you.

5
00:00:13,508 --> 00:00:14,638
(Penny:)He's been crying?

6
00:00:14,801 --> 00:00:18,141
(Sheldon:)Oh, I believe that was something else
I wasn't supposed to mention.

7
00:00:18,305 --> 00:00:21,515
(Penny:)Oh, God. I feel terrible.

8
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:23,723
Do you have a stomachache too?

9
00:00:23,894 --> 00:00:25,354
(Penny:)No. Why, do you?

10
00:00:26,313 --> 00:00:27,853
(Sheldon:)No.

11
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,820
(Penny:)Why did you ask if I had one too?

12
00:00:30,984 --> 00:00:33,824
(Sheldon:)Just making polite
dinner conversation.

13
00:00:34,488 --> 00:00:36,118
(Sheldon:)Your turn.

14
00:00:37,157 --> 00:00:38,657
(Sheldon:)All right.

15
00:00:38,825 --> 00:00:40,665
(Penny:)So, what's new in your life?

16
00:00:41,203 --> 00:00:46,873
(Sheldon:)Well, my new shoes
are not made for running.

17
00:00:48,627 --> 00:00:49,837
(Penny:)Have you been running?

18
00:00:51,254 --> 00:00:52,424
(Sheldon:)No.

19
00:00:53,632 --> 00:00:55,512
(Sheldon:)It's just a suspicion I have.

20
00:00:57,844 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon:)Mm, mm, mm.

